1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,259
Welcome to the Voice of America's Newswords.

2
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:13,580
A museum in Miami, Florida specializes in works of art that stretch the imagination.

3
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:15,740
Illusion.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,920
The Miami Paradox Museum is one of several paradox museums across the world.

5
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:32,719
More than 70 of its displays produce optical illusions worthy of a photograph.

6
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:39,399
The museum explains the math and science behind each illusion.

7
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:47,359
An illusion is anything that is false or not real but that seems to be true or real.

8
00:00:47,359 --> 00:00:57,240
An optical illusion tricks your eyes to make you think you see something that is not present or that looks different in reality.

